resolved_from: records/experiments/alloc11_gate — pure_mom (ungated top-1 momentum over the RISK sleeve) was the frontier at +105.46 pp/yr mean OOS delta (BEATS-SPX 6/9), the widest edge and a re-appearance of the only mechanism ever validated out of sample (v5 dispersion momentum). gated_mom (the GMI-gated synthesis) was MORE consistent (7/9) but lower-return (+61.03) — the brake is a drag on this high-dispersion universe; gmi_bh (timing alone) NO-EDGE -3.35; best_bh NO-EDGE -11.34. The gate answers v11's two questions: momentum rescues the brake (gated_mom >> gmi_bh) but the brake clips momentum's crypto upside (gated_mom < pure_mom).
